                                                                                                               HARDWARE IN 50 WORDS    
Hardware is the physical parts of a computer that you can see and touch.These components work together to process data,store information,and produce results.Example of hardware includes CPU , RAM,Hard drive,Motherboard,Mouse and Monitor. Hardware needs software to
perform specific task and function.Hardware provides the physical structures and processing power necessary for a computer to function,acting as the body of the machine.
                                                                                                               SOFTWARE IN 50 WORDS
Software is a collection of instruction,data,or programs used to operate computers and execute specific tasks.Unlike hardware,software is intangible;it is the code and logic that tells the hardware what to do. It is divided into two main categories:system software (like
Operating system,which manages the hardware) and application software (like web browser or word processors,which perform user specific tasks.) Software acts as the brain of the computer.
                                                                                                          HOW DO HARDWARE AND SOFTWARE INTERACT
Hardware and sotware interact through a continues cycle of istructions and execucations, froming an symbiotric relationship.Tthe software contains the insturctions (code) that are sent to the hardwares processor. 
The hardware then interpretss and executes these instructions, performing calculations,moving data,or displaying information.For example,when type a letteron a keyboard(hardware),the word processor(software)receives that input,process it, and sends a signal
